* 14-opamp-dual.lib - dual op-amp built from a single-channel core in the same file
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.subckt OPAMP_DUAL ina+ ina- outa inb+ inb- outb vcc vee
XA ina+ ina- vcc vee outa OPAMP_CORE
XB inb+ inb- vcc vee outb OPAMP_CORE
.ends OPAMP_DUAL
.subckt OPAMP_CORE 1 2 3 4 5
RIN 1 2 2Meg
G1 0 6 1 2 100u
R1 6 0 1G
C1 6 0 15.9n
E2 7 0 6 0 1
RO 7 5 50
.ends OPAMP_CORE
